#: ../../talk/matterbridge.rst:2
msgid "Matterbridge"
msgstr "Matterbridge"

#: ../../talk/matterbridge.rst:4
msgid ""
"Matterbridge integration in Nextcloud Talk makes it possible to create "
"'bridges' between Talk conversations and conversations on other chat "
"services like MS Teams, Discord, Matrix and others. You can find a list of "
"supported protocols `on the Matterbridge github page. "
"<https://github.com/42wim/matterbridge#features>`_"
msgstr ""
"Med Matterbridge kan Nextcloud Talk lave 'broer' mellem samtaler i Talk og "
"samtaler i andre chattjenester som MS Teams, Discord, Matrix og flere. Du "
"kan finde en liste over understøttede protokoller `på Matterbridges GitHub-"
"side. <https://github.com/42wim/matterbridge#features>`_"

#: ../../talk/matterbridge.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Matterbridge app must be installed by an administrator before this "
"feature is available. See the `Talk administration documentation "
"<https://nextcloud-talk.readthedocs.io/en/latest/matterbridge/>`_ for setup "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Appen Matterbridge skal installeres af en administrator, før funktionen er "
"tilgængelig. Se `dokumentationen til administration af Talk "
"<https://nextcloud-talk.readthedocs.io/en/latest/matterbridge/>`_ for at "
"sætte den op."

#: ../../talk/matterbridge.rst:9
msgid ""
"A moderator can add a Matterbridge connection in the chat conversation "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"En moderator kan tilføje en forbindelse via Matterbridge i "
"samtaleindstillingerne."

#: ../../talk/matterbridge.rst:11
msgid ""
"Talk conversation settings showing Matterbridge chat bridge configuration"
msgstr ""
"Indstillinger for en samtale i Talk med opsætning af Matterbridge-chatbro"

#: ../../talk/matterbridge.rst:15
msgid ""
"Each bridge has its own configuration requirements. Information for most is "
"available on the Matterbridge wiki and can be accessed behind ``more "
"information`` menu in the ``...`` menu. You can also `access the wiki "
"directly. <https://github.com/42wim/matterbridge/wiki>`_"
msgstr ""
"Hver bro har sine egne krav til opsætningen. Oplysninger om de fleste findes"
" i Matterbridges wiki og kan åbnes via ``Flere oplysninger`` i menuen "
"``...``. Du kan også `gå direkte til wikien. "
"<https://github.com/42wim/matterbridge/wiki>`_"
